//! Genuine native proposer/FFG signatures and execution proof, under fixture trust.
//!
//! The fixtures are generated by `examples/qualify_native_ffg.rs` against the
//! pinned native consensus (see `tests/fixtures/native-ffg/provenance.json`).
//! They carry the current native wire tags (synchronous settlement 0x12). The
//! legacy WS-checkpoint settlement store admits only the historical 0x0E
//! envelope, so with current native blocks it can hold no settlement; the
//! tests below pin that it then fails closed rather than standing in for FFG.
#![cfg(unix)]
